SUMMARY:Learning Lunch: Slinging Mud\, Alabama folk pottery
DESCRIPTION:Joey Brackner\, Alabama's state folklorist from 1985 until he 
 retired in 2022\, talks about the 19th century pottery makers of Alabama.
